{"translation-revision-date":"2026-07-09 10:57:33+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.0.3","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"et_EE"},"Run your store from anywhere with the Woo mobile app.":["Halda oma poodi k\u00f5ikjalt Woo mobiilirakendusega."],"Sign-in complete":["Sisselogimine l\u00f5petatud"],"Or get a WordPress.com sign-in link by email:":["V\u00f5i hangi WordPress.com-i sisselogimislink e-posti teel:"],"Scan the QR code below with your phone to sign in instantly \u2014 no password needed.":["Skanni allolev QR-kood oma telefoniga, et kohe sisse logida \u2014 parooli pole vaja."],"Signed in":["Sisse logitud"],"The mobile app will be signed out the next time it tries to reach your store. You can sign in again any time by scanning a new QR code.":["Mobiilirakendus logitakse v\u00e4lja j\u00e4rgmisel korral, kui see proovib sinu poega \u00fchendust v\u00f5tta. Saad igal ajal uuesti sisse logida, skannides uue QR-koodi."],"Revoke access?":["T\u00fchistada juurdep\u00e4\u00e4s?"],"It wasn't you?":["See ei olnud sina?"],"You're sending requests too quickly. Please wait a moment and try again.":["Saadad p\u00e4ringuid liiga kiiresti. Palun oota hetk ja proovi uuesti."],"Failed to revoke access. Please try again or remove the application password manually under Users \u2192 Profile.":["Juurdep\u00e4\u00e4su t\u00fchistamine eba\u00f5nnestus. Palun proovi uuesti v\u00f5i eemalda rakenduse parool k\u00e4sitsi jaotises Kasutajad \u2192 Profiil."],"Signed in successfully":["Sisselogimine \u00f5nnestus"],"The mobile app will be signed out the next time it makes a request.":["Mobiilirakendus logitakse v\u00e4lja j\u00e4rgmisel korral, kui see p\u00e4ringu teeb."],"Access revoked":["Ligip\u00e4\u00e4s t\u00fchistatud"],"Packlink":["Packlink"],"<orderLink>Order #%1$s<\/orderLink> %2$s":["<orderLink>Tellimus #%1$s<\/orderLink> %2$s"],"Your WooPayments test account was successfully created.":["Sinu WooPaymentsi testkonto loodi edukalt."],"We\u2019ve made some exciting improvements to our email templates, including modern, shopper-friendly designs and new customization options. Head to your email settings to explore the new features.":["Oleme teinud oma e-kirja mallides p\u00f5nevaid t\u00e4iustusi, sealhulgas kaasaegsed ja ostjas\u00f5bralikud kujundused ning uued kohandamisvalikud. Uute funktsioonidega tutvumiseks ava oma e-kirjade seaded."],"We\u2019ve made some exciting improvements to your email templates, including modern, shopper-friendly designs and new customization options. Head to your email settings to explore the new changes.":["Oleme teinud sinu e-kirja mallidesse p\u00f5nevaid t\u00e4iustusi, sealhulgas kaasaegsed, ostjas\u00f5bralikud kujundused ja uued kohandamisvalikud. Mine oma e-kirja seadistustesse, et uusi muudatusi uurida."],"Try the new templates":["Proovi uusi malle"],"Store emails have had an upgrade!":["Poe e-kirju on t\u00e4iustatud!"],"Customize your emails":["Kohanda oma e-kirju"],"Your store emails have had an upgrade!":["Sinu poe e-kirju on uuendatud!"],"Set up Google for WooCommerce":["Seadista Google WooCommerce\u2019i jaoks"],"Google for WooCommerce":["Google for WooCommerce"],"There was an error getting your reviews.":["Sinu arvustuste hankimisel ilmnes viga."],"There was an error getting your low stock products.":["Sinu v\u00e4hese laoseisuga toodete hankimisel tekkis viga."],"Please try again.":["Palun proovi uuesti."],"There was an error getting your orders.":["Sinu tellimuste hankimisel tekkis viga."],"App installed":["Rakendus installitud"],"App is installed":["Rakendus on installitud"],"Scan the code below to download or upgrade the app, or visit woo.com\/mobile from your mobile device.":["Skanni allolev kood, et rakendus alla laadida v\u00f5i uuendada, v\u00f5i k\u00fclasta mobiilseadmes lehte woo.com\/mobile."],"Install the mobile app":["Paigalda mobiilirakendus"],"Any troubles signing in? Check out the {{link}}FA